MQTTS TLS 1.3 Mutual Authentication Handshake:
1. Client -> Server: ClientHello (Cipher Suites: TLS_AES_128_GCM_SHA256)
2. Server -> Client: ServerHello + Server Certificate (CN=192.168.1.100) + CertificateRequest
3. Client verifies Server Cert against ca.crt: SUCCESS
4. Client -> Server: Client Certificate (CN=ESP32-Client) + CertificateVerify
5. Server verifies Client Cert against ca.crt: SUCCESS
6. Handshake Finished. Secure Port 8883 Established.
